      "message": "That\u0027s tough to nail down.\n\nAre you sure that we shouldn\u0027t also include commits that appear in a query like\n```\ngit log --grep\u003d\"^BRANCH\u003d.*\\(dartmonkey\\|bloonchipper\\|fingerprint\\).*$\" --regexp-ignore-case\n```\ntoo? Then, we just continue to mark CLs that are relevant for fingerprint, knowing that the \"BRANCH\u003ddartmonkey\" or \"BRANCH\u003dfingeprint\" line signals inclusion in this commit message.",
