      "writtenOn": "2020-03-05T22:51:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that the BRANCH\u003d line is obnoxious and that we couldn\u0027t enforce others to reference fingerprint, but with this implementation we will be missing a ton of very radical changes that impact fingerprint.\nFlashprotect mechanism changes, system_is_locked changes...\n\n---\n\nFrom an offline convo, it seems that we can make this work, but I think we then need to double-down on automatically detecting which files are relevant to a given build target. Unblocking for now.",
